+    "key_observation": "The interesting web-facing surfaces are either protected by user-bound nonces plus administrator/authorized-user gates, or they depend on secret values such as the bookmarklet token or a Stripe checkout session ID that are not exposed to low-privileged attackers by the shipped plugin.",
+    "tooling_notes": [
+      "Phase 1 IR and Semgrep were treated as signal sources only and were revalidated against source.",
+      "The Psalm SARIF artifact existed only as `{\"status\":\"error\",\"exit_code\":1}` and provided no corroborating data."
